# Production deploy

Gotham production is https://trygotham.tech. Localhost is only for checking the work.

The Git remote is `origin` (`pastvayne/summit`). Gotham commits stay on the `gotham` branch. Before a website change, tag the current commit `restore/gotham-YYYY-MM-DD-<short-name>`. After lint, `tsc --noEmit`, and `npm run build`, commit, push with `git push -u origin gotham`, then deploy:

`npx vercel deploy --prod --yes --project gotham --scope ahmedsiddiqui123456-1975s-projects --build-env NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://trygotham.tech`

Never push `summit-kntq` or force-push. Do not deploy contracts, payments, auth, or destructive migrations without a separate request.

"Undo the last change" means revert the latest website commit, push that revert, redeploy, and verify https://trygotham.tech.
